+## Context / Why
+The MVP1 review report Billing item **3.10 “Fix template path handling (multiple fallbacks)”** is required to make bill printing reliable.
+BL-DOC-03 defines the authoritative behavior for `GET /bills/{id}/print`:
+- Prefer Bill-specific template reference
+- Fallback to system param `bill_template_path`
+- Else return **409 Conflict** “Bill template not configured”
+
